OL,3,CWanted man back in prison after
OL,4,Ccommenting on police appeal
OL,6,FA man who was wanted by police has
OL,7,Fbeen returned to prison after
OL,8,Fcommenting on a social media appeal
OL,9,Fabout his own case.
OL,11,FSouth Yorkshire Police issued an
OL,12,Fappeal to find 23-year-old Lewis
OL,13,FJenkins, alongside a custody image,
OL,14,Fafter he failed to attend probation
OL,15,Fappointments.
OL,17,FIn response, Jenkins, from Rotherham,
OL,18,Fclaimed on Facebook that he had been
OL,19,Fstruggling to get hold of the
OL,20,Fresponsible officer.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/3
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
