OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1786745071
OL,3,CWanted man back in prison after
OL,4,Ccommenting on police appeal
OL,6,FUnder the original police appeal he
OL,7,Fcommented: "If my probation officer
OL,8,Fanswered calls and texts it might
OL,9,Fhelp."
OL,11,FHe also complained about the image
OL,12,Fpublished with the appeal, saying:
OL,13,F"They took this photo after a sweaty,
OL,14,Ffully clothed nap in the cells in 35C
OL,15,Fweather."
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Police themselves then
OL,18,Freplied: "Hi Lewis, if you're not
OL,19,Fhappy with your photo please come and
OL,20,Fsee us and we will take a new one."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/3
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
