PN,33103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1786745071
OL,3,CWanted man back in prison after
OL,4,Ccommenting on police appeal
OL,6,FThe force subsequently said Jenkins
OL,7,Fhad been found.
OL,9,FThey said: "Jenkins, who helpfully
OL,10,Fcommented on our appeal to find him,
OL,11,Fhas since been recalled to prison.
OL,13,F"Thank you to everyone, including
OL,14,FJenkins, who interacted with our
OL,15,Fappeal!"
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/3
